@startuml
' Term-level reduction split: how ONE term is reduced across the Dovetail
' rewrite engine (native folds) and the Rholang/Rho machine (COMM), under a
' strictly one-way bridge. Colors: Dovetail = green, Rho/host = blue,
' MeTTaIL compile glue = amber, observation = purple.
title Term-level reduction split — one-way Dovetail-prefold -> lower -> Rho COMM

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #FFB300

|#FFF3E0|MeTTaIL (compile-time, one-way)|
start
:parse term T
(WPDA frontend);
note right
  T = tree of
  COMM/structural nodes
  (PPar, POutput, PInputs,
   PNew, PDrop, NQuote)
  + fold nodes
  (Add, IntBinProc, Eq, ...)
  + Cast* value leaves
end note

|#E8F5E9|Dovetail rewrite engine (native folds)|
:D-stage — saturate_with_native
reduces every fold redex;
note right
  saturate_with_native
  (dovetail/src/rules.rs)
  COMM/new are host-routed:
  carry no fold body,
  left intact (non-fatal)
end note
:report is **Complete**
(folds converge; acyclic
=> no cycle-cut);

if (does T contain COMM?\n(POutput / PInputs / PNew / PDrop)) then (no — pure fold)
  |#E8F5E9|Dovetail rewrite engine (native folds)|
  :F-stage returns
  DeferToDovetailReport;
  |#F3E5F5|Observation|
  :RuntimeBackendOutput::Dovetail
  (the fold-normal value);
  stop
else (yes — COMM or mixed)
  |#FFF3E0|MeTTaIL (compile-time, one-way)|
  :F-stage takes the
  **fold-normal** term
  (folds already reduced,
  COMM preserved);
  :lower_rhocalc_term -> rhoapi::Par
  (succeeds: folds are literals);
  note right
    `@("OUT")!(int(1+2,8))`
    --(Dovetail)--> `@("OUT")!(3)`
    --(lower)--> send(@OUT, 3)
  end note
  |#E3F2FD|Rholang / Rho machine (RhoRuntime + RSpace)|
  :inject Par; run COMM
  (rholang-runtime/src/run.rs);
  note right
    HostRhoMachineReuse.v:
    host owns reduction +
    tuple space. NO callback
    into Dovetail/MeTTaIL
    (BridgeInertness.v).
  end note
  |#F3E5F5|Observation|
  :RuntimeBackendOutput::Observations
  (read resting RSpace data);
  stop
endif
@enduml
